+      "title": "P0043 source status after the September 2026 preprint",
+      "statement": "The historical Benjamini–Schramm criticality conjecture asks whether Bernoulli bond percolation on every infinite connected locally finite quasi-transitive graph G with p_c(G)<1 has no infinite cluster at p_c(G). Lyons–Peres list this as Conjecture 8.15. A public OpenAI preprint dated 24 September 2026 states the full assertion as Theorem 1.1. As of 10 October 2026, this source audit verified the theorem statement and identified a separate Lean solution module, but did not independently check the paper's full proof, the module's imported dependencies, or trusted axioms. Treat the result as a claimed solution pending full referee certification; do not use the older 7 September open label as evidence of current openness.",
